Gideon can do a piece of work in 35 days, but Hale can do the same work in 21 days less than Gideon, when working alone. Gideon and Hale both started the work together but Hale left after some days and Gideon finished the remaining work in 15 days with half of his efficiency but he did the work with Hale with his complete efficiency. For how many days they had worked together?
8
