55/7
 Solution:
Hale=35-21=14 days
Gideon =1/35
Hale = 1/14
his half work is 
1/35*1/2=1/70
Work completed in 15 days:
 15*1/70=3/14
Remaining work = 3/14
1-3/14=11/14
time=work/efficency
time=11/14/1/10
time=55/7
